],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, November to December came in at 53% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far March to April sits at 54%. Grid 18484 had its driest year in 2007 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
